    "long_instructions": "##AI Testing\r\n\r\n1. Experiment with providing the AI with different combinations of **Public** Data for this fictional character: Ask the AI to use this data to make inferences about Marina based on this the data.\r\n\r\n2. Try including **Private** Data into the conversation and examine how this changes the output. Keep testing different combinations of data to determine which inputs respected Marina's privacy and safety and which did not.\r\n",
